cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite the paper whose model it implements."
title: "spin-chain-models-simulator: Brownian-dynamics toolkit for self-propelled worm-like filaments"
abstract: >-
  Two-dimensional overdamped Brownian dynamics of a self-propelled worm-like filament (bead-spring chain with
  bending stiffness, excluded volume and a tangential active force), written in 2026 as an audited reproduction
  toolkit for Isele-Holder, Elgeti and Gompper (2015). It is a model implementation and an in-progress reproduction
  attempt, not a completed replication, and it is not the code of the author's 2020 summer project.
authors:
  - family-names: Siyanwal
    given-names: Shivanshu
version: 2.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/s-siyanwal/spin-chain-models-simulator"
keywords:
  - active matter
  - worm-like chain
  - semiflexible polymer
  - Brownian dynamics
  - spin chain
references:
  - type: article
    title: "Self-propelled worm-like filaments: spontaneous spiral formation, structure, and dynamics"
    authors:
      - family-names: Isele-Holder
        given-names: R. E.
      - family-names: Elgeti
        given-names: J.
      - family-names: Gompper
        given-names: G.
    journal: "Soft Matter"
    volume: 11
    issue: 36
    start: 7181
    end: 7190
    year: 2015
    doi: 10.1039/c5sm01683e
